The implementation of this module was inspired by the Star Citizen Wiki, with some implementations adapted.

== Header ==

{{Tl|Documentation}} always outputs a '''Documentation''' header under any hatnotes, with view, talk, and edit links for the documentation page.

== Usage table ==

Use {{Tl|Documentation/usage}} for a compact quick-look table.

{| class="wikitable"
! Parameter !! Description
|-
| <code>name</code> || Subject's name. Defaults to the template or module page text.
|-
| <code>description</code> || Short description of the template or module. Omitted if empty.
|-
| <code>when</code> || When to use it. Also accepts <code>when_to_use</code>. Omitted if empty.
|-
| <code>usage</code> || Typical invoke, usually via {{Tl|Tl}}. Omitted if empty.
|}

The name row label is '''Template name''' or '''Module name''' based on the subject namespace.
